<title>USA: Dade County, Fla., finance meeting set for Feb 11.</title>
<headline>Dade County, Fla., finance meeting set for Feb 11.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 's Budget, Finance and Public Trust Committee of Dade County, Fla., has scheduled a special meeting Feb 11 at 1330 EST, county officials said.</p>
<p>Some meeting notices were sent out incorrectly listing the meeting date as Wednesday.</p>
<p>An agenda was not yet available.</p>
<p>--Jane Sutton, 305-374-5013</p>
